Baiklah.

251
00:12:45,937 --> 00:12:48,510
Adakah kita akan potong rumput juga?

252
00:12:48,534 --> 00:12:50,148
Ya.

253
00:12:50,171 --> 00:12:53,138
Kita akan potong rumput dekat sungai.

254
00:12:53,161 --> 00:12:56,161
Ada alatan tak?

255
00:12:56,184 --> 00:12:59,665
Saya akan pinjamkan gunting besar.

256
00:12:59,689 --> 00:13:01,555
Terima kasih banyak.

257
00:13:01,578 --> 00:13:05,013
Sila pakai kasut but tinggi, ya.

258
00:13:05,037 --> 00:13:07,171
Kasut but tinggi?

259
00:13:07,194 --> 00:13:09,492
Saya ada.

260
00:13:09,515 --> 00:13:12,327
Baguslah tu!

261
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:15,428
Adakah semua penduduk kampung akan datang?

262
00:13:15,452 --> 00:13:17,222
Ya.

263
00:13:17,245 --> 00:13:20,184
Lebih kurang 20 orang akan berkumpul.

264
00:13:20,207 --> 00:13:24,207
Di Amerika tak ada aktiviti macam ini.

265
00:13:24,230 --> 00:13:27,697
Kita akan bersihkan kampung bersama-sama.

266
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:31,732
Amalan yang bagus.

267
00:13:31,756 --> 00:13:35,164
Selepas bersih, kita minum teh.

268
00:13:35,187 --> 00:13:36,874
Minum teh?

269
00:13:36,898 --> 00:13:39,031
Kelihatan seronok.

270
00:13:39,054 --> 00:13:42,546
Boleh berkenalan dengan penduduk kampung.

271
00:13:42,570 --> 00:13:45,255
Itu bagus.

272
00:13:45,278 --> 00:13:47,644
Saya tak sabar menunggu!

273
00:13:47,667 --> 00:13:51,701
Saya akan datang menjemput esok pagi.

274
00:13:51,724 --> 00:13:54,198
Tolonglah, saya mohon bantuan.

275
00:13:54,221 --> 00:13:55,721
Adegan 7: Teh dan Jeruk / Tea and Pickles

276
00:13:55,721 --> 00:13:59,088
Mike, helo.

277
00:13:59,111 --> 00:14:01,477
Boleh saya masuk?

278
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:06,434
Ya, silakan masuk.

279
00:14:06,457 --> 00:14:09,354
Saya sudah buat jeruk.

280
00:14:09,377 --> 00:14:12,144
Sudah saya bawa.

281
00:14:12,167 --> 00:14:14,734
Jerukkah ini?

282
00:14:14,757 --> 00:14:16,523
Terima kasih banyak.

283
00:14:16,546 --> 00:14:19,788
Mari kita makan sambil minum teh.

284
00:14:19,812 --> 00:14:21,746
Baguslah itu.

285
00:14:21,769 --> 00:14:24,405
Saya akan buatkan teh.

286
00:14:24,428 --> 00:14:27,518
Anda mahu teh panas?

287
00:14:27,541 --> 00:14:31,708
Ya, saya suka teh hijau yang hangat.

288
00:14:31,731 --> 00:14:35,764
Ini jeruk lobak putih.

289
00:14:35,787 --> 00:14:39,636
Jeruk yang putih dan cantik ya.

290
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:44,096
Agak masam, tapi sedap.

291
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,214
Mari kita makan.

292
00:14:46,238 --> 00:14:50,049
Hmm, sedapnya.

293
00:14:50,072 --> 00:14:52,691
Syukurlah.

294
00:14:52,714 --> 00:14:55,447
Suka tak di mulut anda?

295
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:59,737
Ya. Rangup dan sedap.

296
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:03,001
Saya buat sendiri.

297
00:15:03,025 --> 00:15:05,714
Anda boleh buat sendiri?

298
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:08,071
Hebatnya.

299
00:15:08,094 --> 00:15:12,743
Nenek di kampung semua boleh buat.

300
00:15:12,766 --> 00:15:17,166
Di Amerika, kami makan pickles.

301
00:15:17,189 --> 00:15:19,563
Pickles?

302
00:15:19,587 --> 00:15:22,454
Sama macam jeruk kan.

303
00:15:22,477 --> 00:15:26,877
Ya, tapi rasanya sedikit berbeza.

304
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:31,105
Kerana kami guna kicap dan garam Jepun.

305
00:15:31,128 --> 00:15:35,584
Oh begitu, nampak baik untuk kesihatan.

306
00:15:35,607 --> 00:15:40,253
Ya, sangat baik untuk kesihatan.

307
00:15:40,276 --> 00:15:43,152
Anda makan setiap hari?

308
00:15:43,176 --> 00:15:48,709
Ya, pasti makan semasa sarapan.

309
00:15:48,732 --> 00:15:52,369
Boleh ajar saya cara buatnya?

310
00:15:52,393 --> 00:15:56,996
Tentu saja. Senang je.

311
00:15:57,020 --> 00:16:00,253
Bila nak ajar saya?

312
00:16:00,276 --> 00:16:03,876
Minggu depan, kita buat bersama-sama.

313
00:16:03,899 --> 00:16:06,699
Saya sangat gembira!

314
00:16:06,722 --> 00:16:09,289
Saya tak sabar menunggu.

315
00:16:09,312 --> 00:16:13,318
Saya akan petik lobak dari kebun dulu.

316
00:16:13,342 --> 00:16:17,508
Dari kebun? Hebatnya!

317
00:16:17,531 --> 00:16:20,398
Mahu lagi teh?

318
00:16:20,421 --> 00:16:24,038
Ya, saya nak.

319
00:16:24,061 --> 00:16:25,561
Adegan 8: Persiapan untuk Pesta / Preparing for the Festival

320
00:16:25,561 --> 00:16:29,928
Mike, sudah hampir musim luruh ya.

321
00:16:29,951 --> 00:16:34,518
Ya. Angin sudah mulai sejuk.

322
00:16:34,541 --> 00:16:39,474
Hari Ahad minggu depan adalah pesta di kuil.

323
00:16:39,497 --> 00:16:41,830
Pesta?

324
00:16:41,853 --> 00:16:44,261
Nampak menarik.

325
00:16:44,285 --> 00:16:47,652
Kita akan buat persiapan pada hari Sabtu.

326
00:16:47,675 --> 00:16:50,408
Boleh tolong saya?

327
00:16:50,431 --> 00:16:52,570
Tentu saja.

328
00:16:52,593 --> 00:16:55,332
Apa yang boleh saya bantu?

329
00:16:55,356 --> 00:16:58,189
Kami akan menghias tanglung.

330
00:16:58,212 --> 00:17:00,214
Tanglung?

331
00:17:00,238 --> 00:17:03,238
Apakah itu tanglung?

332
00:17:03,261 --> 00:17:07,028
Ia adalah lampu yang diperbuat daripada kertas.

333
00:17:07,051 --> 00:17:09,509
Warnanya merah dan bulat.

334
00:17:09,533 --> 00:17:11,909
Oh, saya tahu.

335
00:17:11,932 --> 00:17:14,066
Cantiknya!

336
00:17:14,089 --> 00:17:18,302
Kemudian, kami akan membersihkan mikoshi.

337
00:17:18,325 --> 00:17:20,492
Mikoshi?

338
00:17:20,515 --> 00:17:24,759
Ya, ia adalah kenderaan untuk dewa.

339
00:17:24,783 --> 00:17:27,787
Adakah mikoshi itu berat?

340
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:30,748
Sangat berat.

341
00:17:30,772 --> 00:17:33,449
Kami akan mengangkatnya bersama-sama.

342
00:17:33,473 --> 00:17:37,006
Pada hari tersebut, bolehkah saya turut mengangkatnya?

343
00:17:37,029 --> 00:17:41,729
Ya, Mike-san juga boleh turut serta mengangkatnya.

344
00:17:41,752 --> 00:17:44,885
Wah, saya mahu mencubanya!

345
00:17:44,908 --> 00:17:47,912
Kami akan memakai pakaian istimewa.

346
00:17:47,936 --> 00:17:50,336
Happi.

347
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:52,293
Happi?

348
00:17:52,316 --> 00:17:54,550
Keren juga!

349
00:17:54,573 --> 00:17:58,573
Saya akan sediakan happi berwarna biru untuk anda.

350
00:17:58,596 --> 00:18:00,529
Terima kasih banyak.

351
00:18:00,552 --> 00:18:02,796
Saya tak sabar menunggu!

352
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:06,257
Adakah di Amerika ada perayaan?

353
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:08,680
Ada perarakan.

354
00:18:08,703 --> 00:18:12,108
Tetapi tiada mikoshi.

355
00:18:12,132 --> 00:18:16,665
Perayaan di Jepun sangat meriah.

356
00:18:16,688 --> 00:18:18,728
Adakah ada gerai-gerai makanan?

357
00:18:18,752 --> 00:18:23,368
Ya. Ada gerai takoyaki dan yakisoba.

358
00:18:23,391 --> 00:18:25,470
Nampak sedapnya!

359
00:18:25,493 --> 00:18:27,942
Saya mahu makan.

360
00:18:27,965 --> 00:18:31,264
Pada waktu malam, bunga api akan dilancarkan.

361
00:18:31,288 --> 00:18:33,455
Bunga api?

362
00:18:33,478 --> 00:18:35,811
Sungguh mengagumkan!

363
00:18:35,834 --> 00:18:39,634
Ambil banyak gambar, ya.

364
00:18:39,657 --> 00:18:42,591
Saya akan tunjukkan kepada keluarga di Amerika.

365
00:18:42,614 --> 00:18:46,790
Datanglah ke kuil pada hari Sabtu, pukul 9 pagi.

366
00:18:46,813 --> 00:18:50,246
Baik. Saya pasti akan datang.

367
00:18:50,269 --> 00:18:51,769
Senario 9: Sejuk Musim Sejuk dan Dapur Kayu Api / Musim Sejuk yang Dingin dan Tungku Kayu

368
00:18:51,769 --> 00:18:56,369
Mike-san, akhir-akhir ini semakin sejuk ya.

369
00:18:56,392 --> 00:19:01,130
Ya, pagi dan malam sangat sejuk.

370
00:19:01,154 --> 00:19:05,425
Musim sejuk di desa lebih sejuk lagi.

371
00:19:05,448 --> 00:19:07,887
Adakah salji turun?

372
00:19:07,911 --> 00:19:11,006
Ya, banyak turun.

373
00:19:11,029 --> 00:19:13,862
Adakah dalam rumah juga sejuk?

374
00:19:13,886 --> 00:19:18,760
Ya, rumah lama ada angin yang masuk melalui celah-celah.

375
00:19:18,783 --> 00:19:21,116
Angin melalui celah-celah?

376
00:19:21,139 --> 00:19:23,424
Apa yang perlu dilakukan?

377
00:19:23,448 --> 00:19:26,381
Gunakanlah dapur kayu api.

378
00:19:26,404 --> 00:19:28,604
Dapur kayu?

379
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:32,194
Maksudnya dapur yang bakar kayu?

380
00:19:32,217 --> 00:19:35,785
Ya, sangat panas dan selesa!

381
00:19:35,809 --> 00:19:38,342
Di mana kita boleh dapat kayu?

382
00:19:38,365 --> 00:19:41,639
Ada banyak kayu di halaman.

383
00:19:41,662 --> 00:19:45,239
Jadi, kita perlu bawa masuk ke rumah, ya?

384
00:19:45,263 --> 00:19:48,530
Betul, setiap hari saya bawanya.

385
00:19:48,553 --> 00:19:51,166
Nampak berat, kan?

386
00:19:51,189 --> 00:19:56,163
Memang, tapi baik untuk senaman.

387
00:19:56,187 --> 00:20:00,454
Di rumah saya di New York, ada pemanasan pusat.

388
00:20:00,477 --> 00:20:02,736
Apa itu?

389
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:07,992
Tekan butang sahaja, seluruh bilik jadi panas.

390
00:20:08,015 --> 00:20:10,815
Wah, senangnya!

391
00:20:10,838 --> 00:20:14,073
Di desa, kita banyak gunakan tenaga badan.

392
00:20:14,097 --> 00:20:17,864
Mike juga potong kayu sendiri?

393
00:20:17,887 --> 00:20:20,853
Ya, saya potong guna kapak.

394
00:20:20,876 --> 00:20:24,893
Kapak? Agak susah, kan?

395
00:20:24,916 --> 00:20:28,483
Saya ajar caranya, tak apa.

396
00:20:28,506 --> 00:20:30,977
Baiklah, saya akan cuba.

397
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,680
Mike nak cuba guna kotatsu?

398
00:20:33,704 --> 00:20:35,937
Kotatsu?

399
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,994
Apa itu?

400
00:20:38,017 --> 00:20:41,095
Meja yang panas!

401
00:20:41,118 --> 00:20:44,956
Duduk dalam kotatsu sambil makan jeruk mandarin, bestnya!

402
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:47,513
Memang best betul!

403
00:20:47,536 --> 00:20:49,803
Saya nak cuba!

404
00:20:49,826 --> 00:20:53,559
Esok saya bawakan kotatsu untuk Mike.

405
00:20:53,582 --> 00:20:55,249
Betul ke?

406
00:20:55,272 --> 00:20:57,672
Terima kasih banyak.

407
00:20:57,695 --> 00:20:59,195
Sesi 10: Keindahan Langit Berbintang

408
00:20:59,195 --> 00:21:03,761
Mike, malam ini langit cantik betul, ya?

409
00:21:03,784 --> 00:21:06,042
Memang cantik!

410
00:21:06,066 --> 00:21:10,032
Banyak bintang kelihatan.

411
00:21:10,055 --> 00:21:13,222
Di desa, udaranya bersih.

412
00:21:13,245 --> 00:21:17,323
Di New York, tak nampak bintang langsung.

413
00:21:17,347 --> 00:21:19,422
Kenapa?

414
00:21:19,445 --> 00:21:23,612
Cahaya bangunan terlalu terang.

415
00:21:23,635 --> 00:21:25,402
Oh, begitu.

416
00:21:25,425 --> 00:21:29,592
Di sini, malam sangat gelap.

417
00:21:29,615 --> 00:21:33,274
Awal-awal dulu, saya takut gelapnya.

418
00:21:33,297 --> 00:21:36,265
Sekarang macam mana?

419
00:21:36,289 --> 00:21:40,165
Sekarang saya suka ketenangannya.

420
00:21:40,188 --> 00:21:43,081
Mike dah biasa dengan kehidupan desa?

421
00:21:43,105 --> 00:21:44,783
Ya.

422
00:21:44,806 --> 00:21:47,374
Setiap hari seronok!

423
00:21:47,398 --> 00:21:50,454
Pemandangan siang pun cantik, kan?

424
00:21:50,477 --> 00:21:51,965
Ada.

425
00:21:51,989 --> 00:21:55,356
Warna gunung sangat indah.

426
00:21:55,379 --> 00:21:59,779
Musim bunga hijau, musim luruh merah.

427
00:21:59,802 --> 00:22:03,574
Perubahan musim sangat jelas.

428
00:22:03,597 --> 00:22:07,964
Air sungai juga sejuk dan jernih.

429
00:22:07,987 --> 00:22:10,387
Ada ikan tak?

430
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:11,863
Ada.

431
00:22:11,886 --> 00:22:15,854
Banyak ikan kecil berenang-renang.

432
00:22:15,878 --> 00:22:19,044
Saya nak cuba memancing di sungai.

433
00:22:19,067 --> 00:22:20,834
Baguslah itu.

434
00:22:20,857 --> 00:22:23,835
Saya pinjamkan alat pancing.

435
00:22:23,858 --> 00:22:25,459
Terima kasih banyak.

436
00:22:25,483 --> 00:22:29,661
Mike pun dah rapat dengan jiran-jiran, ya?

437
00:22:29,685 --> 00:22:33,051
Ya, semua orang di sini sangat baik hati.

438
00:22:33,074 --> 00:22:37,120
Ini kerana Encik Mike selalu memberi salam dengan senyuman.

439
00:22:37,144 --> 00:22:39,877
Memberi salam itu penting, bukan?

440
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:43,467
Adakah awak teringin untuk pulang ke bandar?

441
00:22:43,490 --> 00:22:47,580
Tidak, langsung tidak.

442
00:22:47,603 --> 00:22:50,570
Saya lega mendengarnya.

443
00:22:50,593 --> 00:22:53,926
Saya mahu tinggal di sini selamanya.

444
00:22:53,949 --> 00:22:58,483
Esok, mari kita pergi ke dek pemerhatian di atas bukit.

445
00:22:58,506 --> 00:23:00,472
Dek pemerhatian?

446
00:23:00,495 --> 00:23:03,262
Tempat yang boleh melihat pemandangan?

447
00:23:03,285 --> 00:23:05,018
Ya.

448
00:23:05,041 --> 00:23:07,849
Kita boleh melihat seluruh kampung dari sana.

449
00:23:07,873 --> 00:23:10,007
Saya mahu pergi!

450
00:23:10,030 --> 00:23:12,301
Kita pergi dengan apa?

451
00:23:12,324 --> 00:23:14,991
Mari kita pergi dengan basikal.

452
00:23:15,014 --> 00:23:16,780
Baguslah itu.

453
00:23:16,803 --> 00:23:19,416
Saya tak sabar menunggu.